- **Recommendation:** test/operate **Qwen3-8B OMLX as the local whole-stack candidate first**. It has the strongest validated quality/resource balance. Keep 30B-A3B as the speed-focused consolidation candidate, but do not use it for the whole stack until it passes a larger labeled consolidation corpus and co-resident soak.

